/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 101 0 R
/T (Across India, countless entrepreneurs stand at the edge of untapped possibility, holding products with global potential but unsure of how to carry them beyond their hometowns. Many possess skill, passion, and drive, yet export knowledge often feels like a guarded gateway. Confusing paperwork, scattered information, and a fear of the unknown stop brilliant ideas from crossing borders. Dreams stall not due to lack of ability, but because no one shows them how to turn their local strengths into worldwide opportunities. This hunger for guidance, clarity, and trustworthy support has grown louder than ever; a call for someone to transform hesitation into hope and first steps into global footprints.)
/E (Across India, countless entrepreneurs stand at the edge of untapped possibility, holding products with global potential but unsure of how to carry them beyond their hometowns. Many possess skill, passion, and drive, yet export knowledge often feels like a guarded gateway. Confusing paperwork, scattered information, and a fear of the unknown stop brilliant ideas from crossing borders. Dreams stall not due to lack of ability, but because no one shows them how to turn their local strengths into worldwide opportunities. This hunger for guidance, clarity, and trustworthy support has grown louder than ever; a call for someone to transform hesitation into hope and first steps into global footprints.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
