141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 101 0 R
/T (Answering that call is Chetan Kumar Verma, the force behind Exim Business Advisor and KLick Group, whose work has become a lifeline for aspiring exporters from towns, villages, and growing cities across India. What began as his personal pursuit to understand global trade has evolved into an organization that equips everyday entrepreneurs with the skills, confidence, and tools to step onto the world stage.)
/E (Answering that call is Chetan Kumar Verma, the force behind Exim Business Advisor and KLick Group, whose work has become a lifeline for aspiring exporters from towns, villages, and growing cities across India. What began as his personal pursuit to understand global trade has evolved into an organization that equips everyday entrepreneurs with the skills, confidence, and tools to step onto the world stage.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5 6]
