/E (Chetan grew up in a small district in Jhunjhunu, Rajasthan, where he saw amazing talent, determination, and entrepreneurial spirit in the people around him. He also saw, though, that these traits often stayed hidden because people didn't know how to do business around the world. This lack of knowledge and access made him feel something. He imagined a world where Indian business owners wouldn't have to worry about not knowing enough about international markets)
